  "content": "<h3>此模組需要 <span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib。</a><br></span></h3><h3>僅限 1.21.1 版本，需要 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></span>&nbsp;</span>和 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mamas-herbs-and-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mama's Herbs and Harvest</a></span>。</h3><h2>網站：</h2><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmamailes.com%252fmerrymaking%252fmerrymaking.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mamailes.com/merrymaking/merrymaking.html</a></h2><h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">加入我的 Discord：</span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2QWyQ8fkUr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/2QWyQ8fkUr</a></h3><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F_dDNKkGj1g?si=qm7Bwysg7Bo6hnLi\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mqS0RBe.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"329\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Maiden's MerryMaking 是一款充滿節慶氣氛的聖誕與假日模組，為你的 Minecraft 世界增添內容，讓你能在遊戲中慶祝你最喜愛的節日！</span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">探索各種方塊、物品、生物、成就等，為你的世界帶來節慶樂趣！</span></h3>",
